phi-adapter-matter (0.0.2+chip1.5.1.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * The controller sidecar, phi_adapter_matter_ipc, built as a second gn
    target beside chip-tool: one fabric per instance, commissioning over the
    network with a pairing code, endpoints published as devices with the
    channels their clusters carry (on/off, brightness, color temperature,
    color, motion, contact, temperature, humidity, illuminance, battery).
  * A Connectivity channel on every device, set by the node's subscription,
    and a Remove action that takes the fabric off the device and forgets it.
  * A fresh fabric draws a random operational node id; the UDP port is an
    instance setting so two cores on one host do not collide.
  * Depends on phi-adapter-sdk and avahi-daemon (mDNS through the platform).

 -- Marius Schumacher <marius.schumacher@phisys.com>  Sat, 05 Sep 2026 16:10:00 +0200

